Cell["\<\
The length of the tuple is not checked, and a tuple of another length than \
the degree gives 0, the value of the component of that degree. The gradient \
of the distance, a 1-form, read on one neighbour and on a pair of neighbours.\
\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"c3343bfd-dad7-4013-bb3b-eb9e0274e3a5"],

